            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "## CodeQL / Inconsistent nullness check\n\nThe result of this call to get_gc_connection is not checked for null, but 97% of calls to get_gc_connection check for null.\n\n[Show more details](https://github.com/TokTok/c-toxcore/security/code-scanning/124)",
